<title>ZuriLove Kenya - Find Love</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:sans-serif}
body{background:#fff0f5}
header{background:#fff;padding:15px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{color:#e91e63;font-weight:900;font-size:22px}
.btn{background:#e91e63;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:bold}
